NOTE ON THE OPTIONAL DEPENDENCY

This repository links, by default, against "Blossom VI"
(https://github.com/Paul566/blossom-vi, arXiv:2604.20351), which is licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0.  Blossom VI is NOT redistributed
here: CMake clones it from its upstream repository at configure time.  If you
build this project with -DE2_USE_BLOSSOM_VI=ON (the default) the resulting
binary is a combined work and must be distributed under the GPL-3.0.  The
source code in this repository itself is MIT, as above, and a pure-MIT build is
available with -DE2_USE_BLOSSOM_VI=OFF.
